---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/base-layout.astro";
import Post from "../components/post.astro";
import Link from "../components/link.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
const imageUrl =
    "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/theinsidersandrush/ServiceLogos/refs/heads/main/C%2CC%23%2CC%2B%2B/All.png";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
    <main>
        <Post>
            <h1 slot="header">About me</h1>
            <div slot="content">
                <p>
                    My name is E-vvia, or well my online name that is!<br />
                    I'm a 27 years old programmer that live in... <i
                        >(actually I think I shouldn't disclose where I live)</i
                    >.<br />
                    Since I was a kid I enjoyed computers and the online sea, but
                    It has not been until recently when I decided to open this site.
                    I have been a programmer for various years now and currently I
                    work as a .NET developer.<br />
                    <br />
                    C# is not always my cup of tea but I guess I ended up with a bit
                    of a Stockholm syndrome since I have come to actually enjoy it.
                    Sometimes still like to mess around with some good old C or C++
                    and doing some fun small projects <i
                        >(that usually lead to nowhere)</i
                    >. Obviously I also use html and js in different occasions
                    either when my work requires it or to build this website <i
                        >(it's actually built on Astro though!)
                    </i><br /><br />
                    As for other hobbies I enjoy playing videogames sometimes <i
                        >(when I have the time that is! adulting is hard!!)</i
                    >, play the piano <i>(it's collecting dust!)</i> or playing some
                    board games with friends <i
                        >(Magic the Gathering and Yugioh can be fun! HEY YOU!
                        check <Link
                            href="https://yugisearch.e-vvia.moe"
                            target="_blank">YugiSearch</Link
                        >)</i
                    > and watch the ocacional Anime or Manga that really hits me like
                    a truck. <i>(Totally not Kagepro!)</i><br /><br />
                    Aside from that I ocacionally hop on VRChat and hang out with
                    some friends, using avatars in VR can be quite fun... I might
                    post some pictures in this site!
                </p>
                <figure class="my-5 flex flex-col items-center">
                    <Image
                        width="250"
                        height="250"
                        class="rounded-lg"
                        alt="Shuuya Kano painting a wall in Yobanashi Deceive"
                        src={imageUrl}
                        priority
                    />
                </figure>
            </div>
        </Post>
    </main>
</BaseLayout>
